  "acceptance_blockers": [
    "The initial read-only account fixtures were captured and reviewed, but complete-property, outcome, rename, and update scenarios remain missing.",
    "A stable qualifying-result identity and rename behavior have not been proven.",
    "Cursor continuity was observed, but empty-page termination, deterministic ordering, an incremental overlap boundary, and provider rate/retry policy remain unproven.",
    "The controlled contact returned a blank vendor-contact ID, so the optional call-history endpoint and its notes/attachments contract were not observed.",
    "Undocumented provider response properties were quarantined by fingerprint and require an explicit compatibility policy before production use."
